 esponse\, pathologic categories such as decreased production\, increased d
 estruction/loss\, dilution and sequestration).\n	Select the appropriate in
 itial investigations to differentiate causes of anemia.\n	Select and inter
 pret investigations for hemolysis as a possible cause for anemia.\n	Discus
 s treatment of iron deficiency in different age groups.\n	Select and inter
 pret investigations for iron deficiency anemia.\n	Describe the diagnosis o
 f inherited hemoglobin disorders such as: Sickle cell disease\, thalassemi
 a trait versus thalassemia disease.\n	Discuss the pathophysiology of anemi
 a of chronic inflammation.\n\nView this event online: https://calendar.med
 .ualberta.ca/events/198752
