 y Group:\n	Name: TM Group 7\n\nObjectives:\n	Outline how a patient’s blo
 od group is determined.\n	Recognize the clinical implications of a positiv
 e antibody screen.\n	Describe how the 2 crossmatch processes differ and wh
 en each should be used.\n	Apply blood group knowledge to emergency transfu
 sions.\n	Discuss the role of uncrossmatched blood in clinical care.\n	Desc
 ribe the mechanisms of hemolytic transfusion reactions caused by isohemagg
